Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:11.70,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I woke up again with the same regret
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.70,0:22:16.24,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Jump into this mess no exit yet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.35,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Every choice I make it falls apart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.35,0:22:23.03,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the beat the groove is in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.69,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Pathetic I wear it like a crown
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.69,0:22:29.34,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I crash I burn I laugh out loud
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.34,0:22:30.87,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.92,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:38.63,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.63,0:22:41.76,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:45.77,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.77,0:22:47.70,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,They think they know me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:49.61,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the old me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.63,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Used to control me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.63,0:22:54.23,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But now they moldy… yup
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:55.65,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Committed and I did it and you label me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.74,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,a menace and a villain cause you can’t get with it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.66,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,hate my presence hate my business
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.54,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,got no feelings… good riddance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:05.21,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:09.87,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.87,0:23:13.01,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.01,0:23:17.67,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.33,0:22:11.70,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我帶著相同悔恨醒來
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.70,0:22:16.24,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,縱身躍進這仍無出口的混亂中
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.35,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,每個選擇都讓一切崩壞
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.35,0:22:23.03,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但這節拍紮根 律動在我血脈
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.03,0:22:26.69,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,可悲啊 我仍引以為傲
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.69,0:22:29.34,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我崩潰我燃燒我大笑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.34,0:22:30.87,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,耶！耶！耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.92,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知魯莽
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.92,0:22:38.63,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有瘋狂 讓我活下來
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.63,0:22:41.76,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲絕望頌 只為我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.76,0:22:45.77,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.77,0:22:47.70,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,他們自以為懂我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.70,0:22:49.61,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但那已是過去的我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.61,0:22:51.63,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,習慣控制我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.63,0:22:54.23,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,早成過期貨…呵
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.23,0:22:55.65,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我做到了 你還在貼標籤
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.65,0:22:57.74,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,視我為威脅 說我是惡棍 因為你接不住招
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.66,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,憎恨我的存在 詆譭我的行為
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.54,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,無所謂…好走不送
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.54,0:23:05.21,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知魯莽
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.21,0:23:09.87,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有瘋狂 讓我活下來
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.87,0:23:13.01,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲絕望頌 只為我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.01,0:23:17.67,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
